    {
      "content": "A big Pacific Northwest quake could cause land to sink in minutes",
      "mime": "text/plain",
      "type": "title",
      "subtype": "h1"
    },
    {
      "content": "Scientists say the region is overdue for a major tremor, and a new study predicts serious flooding would result along with shaking and a tsunami.",
      "mime": "text/plain",
      "type": "deck"
    },
